{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/114b4e6d76018c7e7e36de47f8158a7d71794d04f1a575e31408803c59ba962ac3b15579c1534fce4b47bcccb7fb81f590aff7676a92c371b704a7732e05fed7","height":1400,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/2AT_TIxyMX0Inqd9Rk4ejaFoRmOOczEwM9E5xz4DfYxaUqgdkXsCRKOX3uHYFOjyU9VwwFzGGCsZnf6BYmkPP0x3OjztRk02SB3O_HOBLz_vXdvoi2g","width":1400},"name":"Liam Spradlin","title":"Senior UX Designer, Material Design"},"document_id":5402053906792448,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":[],"content":"<p dir=\"ltr\">读到这里的你，也许已经知道，&ldquo;Material 是一个设计系统 &ndash; 以开源代码为支撑 &ndash; 帮助团队打造高品质的数字体验。&rdquo;这句话是我们在 2018 年随 Material Theming 发布时引入的，它概括了我们正在为社区、并与社区一起努力构建的东西。</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&lt;br&gt;</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">但我们知道，支撑 Material Design 的不仅仅是开源代码。在组件及其代码之外，真正支撑 Material Design 的还有一群人。作为一个构建设计系统的团队，我们的用户不只是世界上使用应用的人，还包括构建应用的人、设计应用的人，以及以各种其他角色让这些应用和产品变为现实的人。作为一名设计师和设计布道师（Design Advocate），我（以及团队的其他成员）的一部分工作，就是帮助所有这些人把 Material 当作工具、解决方案、起点或灵感来使用，并借此获得成功。</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&lt;br&gt;</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Material Design Advocacy 团队里与我并肩作战的伙伴们，已经通过各种出版物和平台制作了视频、文章、播客和大会演讲来助力这一目标。但拥有能帮助社区更好、更快地构建的声音、视角和洞见的，并非只有我们。在交互设计、视觉设计、动效设计、工程、研究和工具等领域，Material 团队里满是乐于分享经验和想法的杰出人才。</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&lt;br&gt;</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">通过新闻动态、分步指南、设计探索、研究结论和合作伙伴案例研究，这个博客不仅会介绍如何使用 Material Design，还会讲述这个系统是如何打造的。在探索指南与代码之外的话题时，我们希望你，读者，能直接从实践者那里，了解这些成果背后的一切工作。</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&lt;br&gt;</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">作为编辑，我的目标是把这些声音和故事汇聚到同一个地方。欢迎来到 Material 博客。</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&lt;br&gt;</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&lt;br&gt;</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Liam，谨代表 Material Design</p>","image":[],"related_links":[],"table":[],"video":[]}],"category":"2020","hero":{"a11y_description":"Illustration showing the outline of an eye and a floating action button, surrounded by abstract shapes.","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/8b4bb27e94b6b41b638496c068aeea2c0c2664ba8ecce5d88d4b1d05951eb3ea960861748b825e11e21fb2d4aade69265496a1bb1fb48cbe01ecb6b7a5941765","height":3501,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/jEnGSii1ALI3l2mLtobU8e0uIfdkf8eg8ic3koughUw5N38UAwe6rLrmIaZo9ee3RmJ50pU8hTSClYXjEJdAtuiFCjiUoDd66aEfSA","width":7001}},"hero_card":false,"metadata":{"keywords":null,"meta_robots":" ","schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"一个了解 Material Design 的地方，探索指南与代码之外的内容","share_image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/ed8f92d35ff7ea24d579de89de1f7925380468f0b9b50268252a69388674fc90648e4193153478fca1e7aa81ca6dd506045aad6e813544c462aee8e8478e8061","height":3501,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/O15TznNmyF5obgvMK5y-_boJu967qkG6X4AtI8G00YAyimSgwGReS5znNN5jYkIlUSsnCyA1IUxBc1Ex4gH28xvgFLZQ88yBgn_A-9M","width":7001},"share_title":"Welcome to the Material Blog"},"published_date":"2020-09-01T13:00:00","slug":"material-design-blog-welcome","subtitle":"Material Design，超越指南与代码","title":"欢迎来到 Material 博客—编辑寄语","up_next":{"items":[{"collection_id":"UpNextItems","document_content":{"image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_67af19389b5f45048ff0f3b64759ab41_/71b873d3c00ebb9924495297d956b10a057a9bc599d50a0cfd141fb26afb14acc4926b20bd9b32dc491db0aed5c5270426f2c9de5d18d5c70269dca2cefb3ed1","height":5001,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/nUJTOrsF4VN5m2UMBM-J4lVD_W7wujCjUKLU8xH4wzikNlr6gdNRmga2okU7_lABELi5Ss3AjDyhSQc7Ay7vCZZ5gZahzB9Use8T3w","width":6251},"link":{"aria_label":null,"href":"/blog/design-material-theme-color","label":null,"open_new_window":false},"section":"Material Blog","title":"Designing a Material Theme: Color"},"document_id":5709731908550656,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"},{"collection_id":"UpNextItems","document_content":{"image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_67af19389b5f45048ff0f3b64759ab41_/2f95c86bdc1b02ce73d92619